<title>USA: Louisville feeder cattle mostly steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Louisville feeder cattle mostly steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>LOUISVILLE 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were mostly steady, instances $1.00 per cwt higher on calves under 500 lbs, compared to Monday's close, USDA said. Feeder Steers:  Medium and Large 1 600-700 lbs 75.00-80.50; 700-800 lbs 73.00-74.25. Holsteins: Large 2 600-700 lbs 63.70; 700-800 lbs 64.50.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers:  Medium and Large 1 500-600 lbs</p>
<p>70.00-78.75, package blacks 520 lbs 80.25.</p>
<p>Cattle and Calves Receipts: 656</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
